{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55303","headline":"和座主王公仁裕见贺入相诗（题拟） · 王溥","name":"和座主王公仁裕见贺入相诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"挥毫文战偶搴旗，待诏金华亦偶爲。\n白社遽当宗伯选，赤心旋遇圣人知。\n九霄得路荣虽极，三接承恩出每迟。\n职在台司多少暇，亲师不及舞雩时。\n（见《广卓异记》卷六，又见《增修诗话总龟》卷十四引。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王溥","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55303.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55303","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}